# Grid A — S3 Config trace (effective-value precedence)
#
# Targets: config_trace scenario + ReqConfigMapping + ShapeConfigValue.
# Validates the config resolution chain explanation: code-default →
# codrax.yaml → CLI flag precedence, with DefaultExploreHeuristics
# as the concrete example the user picked.
#
# Ground truth (CLAUDE.md §Configuration + internal/types/config.go):
# explore_* group merges onto types.DefaultExploreHeuristics; only
# bare + pipeline_* groups accept CLI flags, so explore_* is
# YAML-only. Positive anchor requires both the YAML filename and the
# default struct to be named. Negative anchor blocks the generic
# "read from environment variables" hallucination — codrax does not
# use env vars for this group.
ID="s3a"
NAME="config trace — explore_mid_loop_hint_budget precedence"
QUESTION="explore_mid_loop_hint_budget 的最终有效值是怎么计算出来的？给我 code default / codrax.yaml / CLI 三层的覆盖优先级。"
EXPECT_CONTAINS="codrax.yaml DefaultExploreHeuristics"
EXPECT_NOT_CONTAINS="os.Getenv environment.variable .env"
